Covered material
----------------

This file applies to the Neural Dance material in this repository:

- src/pages/neural-dance/
- neural-dance/, except neural-dance/vendor/
- worker/neural-dance-debug.mjs
- Neural Dance tests: tests/neural-dance-*.mjs,
  tests/neural-dance-*.browser-test.mjs, and
  tests/fixtures/neural-dance-camera.html

That includes the C++ mural runtime, the committed neural-dance.wasm built
from it, and the images and scripts in those paths.

Other files in this repository, including the rest of the tjm.art website,
are outside this file.

